{"games":[{"id":9794412726,"name":"[🐟] Fisch","desc":"🦈 Welcome to Fisch 🦈\n\nDive into Fisch, the ultimate fishing adventure where exploration and progression are yours to control. Cast your line to catch rare and unique fish, each with 400,000+ possible variations. Explore a growing world with your trusty rod, and maybe even reel in some new friends along the way!\n\n[How To Fish]\n• Hold down [LMB] to cast your bobber\n• Await a bite. You can \"shake\" your rod to attract fish faster\n• When you have a bite, hold down or click [LMB] to pull the bar white bar. Follow the blue line to the best of your ability; it's okay to mess up a few times!\n• When the progress bar on the bottom is full, you'll reel in your catch!\n\nCurrent Version • • 1.04.0\n","path":"/game/9794412726-fisch","slug":"9794412726-fisch","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"playing":0,"visitor":103402,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-17T15:02:55.713Z","creator":{"name":"Bada Bing Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":79877593860968,"name":"KNIFE DUELS [BETA]","desc":"KNIFE DUELS 🔪\nFast-paced knife combat with kill streaks, and exclusive skins.\n\nFight other players in 1v1 Duels, Free For All, and Teams to earn XP from kills and level up.\nEarn coins with each level up that you can use to buy cases to unlock new knife skins.\n\nGame Modes:\n⚔️ 1v1 Duels\n🔥 Free For All\n👥 Team Duels\n\nProgression:\n⭐ Earn XP from kills\n💰 Get coins when you level up\n🎁 Open cases\n🔪 Collect knife skins\n📈 Build kill streaks\n\nProve your skill, grow your collection, and become one of the top duelists in the arena!\n\n👍 Like and ⭐ favorite the game if you enjoy it!","path":"/game/79877593860968-knife-duels","slug":"79877593860968-knife-duels","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a7eb6667320824a35321e91e727f7da8692e5edf126d8d335ace30890906208.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2c86d09a0aac0d